# {{lb|en|transport}} A major [[transit]] [[corridor]] in a system of [[road]]s, [[river]]s, or [[railway line]]s.
#* {{quote-journal|en|year=1951|month=April|author=D. S. Barrie|title=British Railways: A Survey, 1948-1950|journal=Railway Magazine|issue=600|page=232|text=But the importance of  the railways as main '''arteries''' of the national economy remains undimmed, just as their fascination for the railway enthusiast is surely undiminished.}}
